title: Luca
---
<<declare $helpedLuca = false>>

<<if $helpedLuca>>
    Luca: Thanks again for helping me!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Luca: Hey, can you help me with something?

-> Sure! <<if hasActions()>>
    <<jump HelpLuca>>
-> Not right now.
    <<jump DeclineLuca>>
===

title: HelpLuca
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $helpedLuca = true>>
Luca: Thanks! I appreciate it.
<<stop>>
===

title: DeclineLuca
---
Luca: Alright, maybe later.
<<stop>>
===